# Copy this file to .env (gitignored) for local overrides.
# Flags can also be set inline at build time, e.g.:
#   VITE_FF_X=false bun run build:web
#
# Build-time feature flags follow the VITE_FF_<NAME> convention.
# Polarity: absent or any value other than "false", "0", or "off" = enabled.
#           "false" | "0" | "off" = disabled.
# See src/lib/feature-flags.ts for the parseFlag() implementation.

# VITE_FF_EXAMPLE=false
# VITE_FF_MULTI_LANG=false  # hide language toggle and lock UI to English
